Restating the Core Solution Mechanics


✅ Firmware Extraction Rule

Resolving firmware image targets relies on using entropy checks and binwalk parsing signatures to automatically carve out the underlying filesystem layout. If working with a non-OS bare-metal target, you must deduce the Loading Base Address using absolute string memory references before loading the raw machine code bytes into code decompilers.
